      "lines": [
        "$y=-\\frac{a}{b}x+\\frac{c}{b}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "这就是说，当 $b\\ne0$ 时，不管 $a$",
        "取什么值（包括 $a=0$ 的情况），",
        "方程 $ax+by=c$ 表示的是线性",
        "函数，它的图象是直线。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "label": "图 97",
      "box": [
        862,
        261,
        500,
        505
      ],
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [],
      "id": "fig-97"
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "满足方程 $2x+0y=12$ 的",
        "数对只能是所有这样的数对，",
        "$x$ 的值必须等于 6，而 $y$ 值是任",
        "意数，如 $(6,0.01)$，$(6,-18)$，$(6,1004)$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "label": "图 97",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": true,
      "lines": [
        "图 97"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "方程 $2x+0y=12$ 的图象，是横坐标为 6、纵坐标为任意",
        "数的点的集合。这个点集是过点 $A(6,0)$ 且平行于 $y$ 轴的直",
        "线（图 98）。"
      ]
    },
